sequenceDiagram
    title UC07 景点浏览与购票——对象级顺序图
    participant P0 as 用户
    participant P1 as AttractionList.vue
    participant P2 as AttractionController
    participant P3 as AttractionServiceImpl
    participant P4 as AttractionMapper
    participant P5 as AttractionOrderMapper
    P0->>P1: 选择景点和票数
    P1->>P2: GET /search 并 POST /{id}/ticket
    P2->>P3: searchAttractions()/buyTicket()
    P3->>P4: 读取景点价格与票量
    P4-->>P3: 返回景点
    P3->>P5: 计算金额并新增门票订单
    P5-->>P3: 返回 orderNo
    P3-->>P2: 返回订单凭证入口
    Note over P0,P5: 成人/儿童票数与金额必须服务端计算；用户只能查看自己的凭证。
